  "interpretation_limits": [
    "All rows use the original four selected perf windows; archived pacing timestamps are matched to actual perf timestamps before selection.",
    "Staging-created counts include dedicated upload and readback resources and are distinct from the GPU-only transfer pool.",
    "Large-allocation log counts only include logged creations; small dedicated buffers are not exhaustively logged.",
    "Texture-download MiB counters exclude buffer-cache downloads and do not identify the caller or necessity of every transfer.",
    "Allocation totals are cumulative churn, not simultaneous committed memory.",
    "Fence wait elapsed time is the recording-thread scope, not an independently additive or fully recoverable component of frame duration.",
    "The measured pressure-readback wait subinterval is shorter than the 1200-frame capture; its mean per call is not a per-frame metric.",
    "Historical comparisons establish different runtime behavior, not a controlled causal effect of patch 0020.",
    "Composite latency is an average rounded in the original log, not an additional duration to add to frame time.",
    "The contiguous-row copy inefficiency is verified in source and unchanged from .17; its frequency and cost in BOTW remain unmeasured.",
    "Upstream changes were inspected but not integrated, compiled or benchmarked in this research turn.",
    "No raw logs, credentials, game paths, guest code or generated binaries included."
